    "body": "The discussion so far has convinced me that we should not make `ReadableStream` disposable. It adds to much complexity for not enough benefit, and encourages bad interactions with tee and piping. And, IMO it's bad practice to call `cancel()` with no argument anyway, and the using syntax does not give a place to insert the appropriate argument.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
