    "created_at": "2024-03-03T05:17:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-03-03T05:17:43Z",
    "body": "Ok, I think given the discussion and after running through a ton of scenarios in which I've failed to convince myself that it could work, I think we've hit the right conclusion here and will close this issue. I'd say that even making readers and writers disposable is probably not something that is critical at all. Thank you for the consideration on it. I do think we need to have similar conversations and considerations for other web platform apis like `Request`, `Response`, etc, but those are best had in those repos.",
