    "updated_at": "2025-02-20T20:51:42Z",
    "body": "So, is the conclusion that the stream API would not integrate with explicit resource management at all? Though making streams disposable seems complex, I think making readers disposable would not be, and the proposal quotes `stream.getReader` as one potential use case anyway, but I didn't find any relevant discussion in this repo.",
